The diagram on the left shows the path of Bill's walk. As the diagram on the right illustrates, she could also have walked from $A$ to $B$ by first walking 1 mile south then $\frac{3}{4}$ mile east. [asy]
pair a=(0,1), b=(.75, 0), c=(0,.5), d=(.75,.5), o=(0,0);
